WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:03.860
You.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.640
You will never be me.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:06.380
Never

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:08.580
You will never play like me.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.440
You won’t wear this shirt

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:11.960
or dance like me.

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.320
You will never be me.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:16.820
...YOU?!

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.200
I don’t want to be YOU.

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.600
I don’t want to be anything like you.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.980
I don’t want to play like you

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:25.160
Or dance like that.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:27.760
I don’t want to wear your name on MY back

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.600
Or see your numbers on MY phone.

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.520
Your flock of ‘Insta-finger-likers’

00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:33.120
- keep ‘em, I’ll get my own.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.960
I don’t want your face or your fame…

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:36.960
...and I don’t want to hear YOUR name

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:37.920
when I play MY game

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.000
Don’t want your signature

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:41.760
Or your signature moves.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.920
Don’t want your glory.

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:43.760
Don’t want your hype.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:45.920
Don’t want your back-page type

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.600
Your player reel ain’t real to me.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:49.840
Your promo deal ain’t really me.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:51.580
You will never be MY commentary.

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:53.660
Let me be clear,

00:00:54.060 --> 00:00:55.660
I don’t want to be YOU...

00:00:56.040 --> 00:00:58.420
I just want your boots.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.040
NEVER FOLLOW

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:09.780
I’m Paul Pogba.

00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:10.860
You be you.

